Package: maluos-agents
Architecture: all
Depends: ${misc:Depends}, python3 (>= 3.12), python3-gi, gir1.2-glib-2.0, gir1.2-gtk-4.0, gir1.2-adw-1, gir1.2-webkit-6.0, desktop-file-utils, xdg-user-dirs, maluos-desktop-session (>= 0.6.0), maluos-agent (>= 0.3.0), maluos-vault (>= 0.3.0)
Recommends: maluos-desk (>= 0.3.0), xdg-terminal-exec
Description: MaluOS Agents app: talk to and control local and office agents
 One window for every agent the person can use: the agents on this desk
 (theirs first) and, on a desk enrolled with a Business OS office, the
 office's agents. For the selected agent: Talk (tasks sent and answers
 received over the agent's task interface), Control (start, stop,
 restart, logs, a one-off command), Policy, Memory and Activity. The UI
 is web technology in a WebKitGTK window; the native side is this
 package's Python: the session bus, the task sockets, the vault, the
 office and the icons.
 .
 The icons: one launcher per agent in the Agents folder of the GNOME
 grid and in ~/Desktop/Agents, kept in sync by the session service as
 agents come and go (maluos-agents --sync).
